    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can our technical architecture meet these requirements while ensuring sovereignty of data through SecNumCloud-type infrastructure or equivalent?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval requires integration with existing systems, including business software, EDM, and user directories, via API interfaces." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also provide response times under 2 seconds and guarantee high availability (99.9%)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can our technical architecture meet these requirements while ensuring sovereignty of data through SecNumCloud-type infrastructure or equivalent?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The City of Belval requirements, our technical architecture can leverage API gateways such as Kong or Apigee to integrate with existing systems via REST, GraphQL, or SOAP interfaces." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For EDM systems like Alfresco or Maarch Courrier, our can utilize CMIS standards for integration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "User directories can be connected through identity providers like Active Directory/LDAP, Keycloak, or FranceConnect." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure response times under 2 seconds, our can optimize our RAG framework using LangChain, LlamaIndex, or Haystack, and fine-tune our LLM models with methods like LoRA or QLoRA. our vector databases such as Qdrant or Weaviate can also be optimized for fast query performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For high availability, our can deploy The solution on a cloud provider like OVHcloud, Scaleway, or Outscale, which offer SecNumCloud-type infrastructure, ensuring sovereignty of data. our can also utilize containerization with Docker and Kubernetes to ensure scalability and reliability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, implementing monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack will help our achieve the required 99.9% availability. our past performance benchmarks indicate that our can achieve a p95 response time of 1800ms, which is below the required 2 seconds, and our have achieved an availability of 99.92% on past projects, exceeding the required 99.9%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our experience with SecNumCloud deployments and hybrid infrastructure, our can design a solution that meets the City of Belval's requirements while ensuring sovereignty of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender demands strict GDPR compliance, including exclusive EU hosting, no data transfer outside EU, encryption of sensitive data, and explicability of recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls and measures do we need to implement to ensure we solution complies with these regulatory requirements and maintains the sovereignty of data?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender demands strict GDPR compliance, including exclusive EU hosting, no data transfer outside EU, encryption of sensitive data, and explicability of recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls and measures do we need to implement to ensure we solution complies with these regulatory requirements and maintains the sovereignty of data?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To comply with The tender GDPR requirements, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., already has several relevant security controls in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For exclusive EU hosting, we standard data residency is \"EU only\", which aligns with this requirement. we also have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits data transfers outside EU unless there is an explicit legal basis, ensuring no unauthorized data movement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For encryption of sensitive data and explicability of recommendations, while the provided context does not explicitly mention encryption methods or explicability measures for AI recommendations, we do have experience with anonymisation tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models. anonymisation tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models could potentially support the encryption or protection of sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, we GDPR posture includes having a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed, with contact information available at dpo@nexus-engineering.it. we also have experience with Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIA), which can help identify and mitigate risks related to personal data processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further ensure compliance, we should focus on implementing additional controls such as ensuring all data processed by we AI systems is anonymized using tools like Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) or custom NER models before any model updates. we existing capability for output PII redaction in AI security controls also supports protecting sensitive information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the emphasis on explicability of recommendations, we might need to enhance we AI system's transparency and accountability features, although specific methods are not detailed in the provided context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Enhancing we logging capabilities to include comprehensive auditing of data access and processing could also support compliance, building on we existing log immutability method using append-only with SHA-256 hash chaining." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, ensuring that all queries are logged, as per we current audit and logging practices, will help maintain a clear record of system activity, supporting both security and regulatory compliance requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering the City of Belval's emphasis on GDPR compliance, explicability, transparency, and responsibility, what legal risks should we be aware of, and how can we ensure we contract complies with all relevant EU regulations, including those related to AI and data protection?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering the City of Belval's emphasis on GDPR compliance, explicability, transparency, and responsibility, what legal risks should we be aware of, and how can we ensure we contract complies with all relevant EU regulations, including those related to AI and data protection?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As Legal Counsel for Nexus Engineering S.r.l., Legal Counsel for Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can inform you that we are aware of the importance of GDPR compliance, explicability, transparency, and responsibility." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The typical legal risks we monitor include open-source licence compliance, cross-border data flow, AI Act compliance evolution, and vendor lock-in mitigation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure our contract complies with all relevant EU regulations, including those related to AI and data protection, we should focus on the following:  we standard contractual clauses include a data return on termination mechanism and a data destruction certificate, which aligns with GDPR requirements.  we have expertise in AI Act and are aware of prohibited AI practices, limited risk AI transparency obligations, and human oversight contractual enforcement. we GDPR legal instruments include a DPA template version 3.2, and we support Data Protection Impact Assessments. we should ensure that our contract includes provisions for transparency, explicability, and responsibility in AI decision-making processes, as well as compliance with Article 6(1)(e) of GDPR as we standard legal basis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, Legal Counsel for Nexus Engineering S.r.l. do not have specific information on the City of Belval's requirements beyond general EU regulations and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard practices." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years and the need to optimize costs while maintaining quality of service, what financial strategy should we adopt to ensure we solution is affordable for the City of Belval, and what projected margin can we anticipate from this contract?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years and the need to optimize costs while maintaining quality of service, what financial strategy should we adopt to ensure we solution is affordable for the City of Belval, and what projected margin can we anticipate from this contract?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "I do not have information about a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years or the specifics of this contractract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The provided context does not mention these details." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide a financial strategy and projected margin, I would need more specific information about the project in question, such as the project in question budget allocation, forecasted costs, and potential revenue streams." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the City of Belval's requirements for an intelligent assistance tool that can provide contextualized answers, assist in drafting administrative contents, and suggest actions or steps in administrative processes, what AI technologies and innovations should we leverage, and how can we ensure our solution contributes to reducing the environmental footprint through efficient use of resources?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the City of Belval's requirements for an intelligent assistance tool that can provide contextualized answers, assist in drafting administrative contents, and suggest actions or steps in administrative processes, what AI technologies and innovations should we leverage, and how can we ensure our solution contributes to reducing the environmental footprint through efficient use of resources?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the City of Belval's requirements for an intelligent assistance tool, we can leverage we expertise in large language models (LLMs) such as Mistral 7B Instruct, which is we preferred sovereign model due to Mistral 7B Instruct, which is our preferred sovereign model due to its strong performance in French and self-hostable nature strong performance in French and self-hostable nature." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Mistral 7B Instruct, which is our preferred sovereign model due to its strong performance in French and self-hostable nature can be fine-tuned using methods like LoRA or QLoRA to achieve domain adaptation for administrative contents and processes. we can also utilize Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities, combining retrieval strategies such as dense vector semantic search with we experience in vector stores like Qdrant or Weaviate." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This approach will enable Mistral 7B Instruct, which is our preferred sovereign model due to its strong performance in French and self-hostable nature to provide contextualized answers by effectively retrieving relevant information from a knowledge base and generating accurate responses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure efficient use of resources and reduce environmental footprint, we can apply quantization methods such as INT8 to reduce energy consumption without significantly compromising model performance. we experience with Mistral 7B Instruct, which is our preferred sovereign model due to its strong performance in French and self-hostable nature indicates that using INT8 quantization results in approximately 80% less energy usage compared to larger models like 70B models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we should prioritize quarterly offline fine-tuning on anonymized data to comply with GDPR regulations and minimize the need for real-time learning from user data. prioritize not only adheres to privacy requirements but also contributes to a more sustainable use of computational resources by avoiding continuous online updates." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By focusing on these technologies and methodologies, we solution can effectively support the City of Belval's administrative tasks while promoting environmentally responsible AI practices through efficient resource utilization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the City of Belval's commitment to sustainable development and reducing the City of Belval's systems' environmental footprint, how can our proposed solution not only meet but exceed the City of Belval's commitment to sustainable development and reducing its systems' environmental footprint by relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact and contributing to the reduction of energetic consumption?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the City of Belval's commitment to sustainable development and reducing the City of Belval's systems' environmental footprint, how can our proposed solution not only meet but exceed the City of Belval's commitment to sustainable development and reducing its systems' environmental footprint by relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact and contributing to the reduction of energetic consumption?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can help exceed the City of Belval's commitment to sustainable development and reducing its systems' environmental footprint through our green hosting partners, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France and utilizing 100% renewable energy. our digital sobriety practices also contribute to reducing energy consumption, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our typical energy reduction versus baseline is around 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these capabilities, our can help reduce the environmental footprint of its systems' while meeting the City of Belval's commitment to sustainable development." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "# 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Executive Summary Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. specialized agents, is pleased to submit a comprehensive tender proposal for the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in the City of Belval. a comprehensive tender proposal for the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in the City of Belval integrates technical architecture, security compliance, legal counsel, budget management, AI innovation, and CSR sustainability to meet the City of Belval objectives of improving administrative service efficiency and quality. # 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Understanding of Requirements the City of Belval seeks a solution that provides intelligent assistance to municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions, facilitating access to information, improving answer quality, and reducing processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected functionalities include assistance with information consultation, drafting, file instruction, collaboration, and continuity of processing, all while respecting regulatory requirements such as GDPR, ensuring explicability and transparency, and maintaining a high level of security and availability. # 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposed Solution Proposed Solution leverages a phased approach, utilizing established methodologies like PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, or SAFe, tailored to the City of Belval specific needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The technical architecture will integrate with existing systems via API gateways (Kong or Apigee), utilizing REST, GraphQL, or SOAP interfaces for EDM systems like Alfresco or Maarch Courrier and user directories through identity providers like Active Directory/LDAP, Keycloak, or FranceConnect." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve response times under 2 seconds, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will optimize Nexus Engineering S.r.l." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "RAG framework with LangChain, LlamaIndex, or Haystack, fine-tuning Nexus Engineering S.r.l." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "LLM models (specifically Mistral 7B Instruct) with methods like LoRA or QLoRA." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Vector databases such as Qdrant or Weaviate will be optimized for fast query performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Deployment on cloud providers like OVHcloud, Scaleway, or Outscale, which offer SecNumCloud-type infrastructure, ensures sovereignty of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For high availability, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will deploy Proposed Solution using containerization with Docker and Kubernetes, ensuring scalability and reliability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack will be implemented to achieve 99.9% availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk160> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. past performance benchmarks indicate a p95 response time of 1800ms and an availability of 99.92%, exceeding the required thresholds." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk161> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Security compliance is ensured through Nexus Engineering S.r.l." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk162> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "GDPR posture, which includes a Data Protection Officer (DPO), data residency in the EU, and no cross-border transfers without explicit legal basis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk163> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will implement additional controls such as anonymization tools like Microsoft Presidio for sensitive data protection and ensure explicability of AI recommendations, though specific methods may need to be detailed further." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk164> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. contract will include provisions for transparency, explicability, and responsibility in AI decision-making processes, complying with Article 6(1)(e) of GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, due to limitations in provided information, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. cannot specify a financial strategy or projected margin without more details on budget allocation and forecasted costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk166> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The AI innovation component leverages Nexus Engineering S.r.l. expertise in LLMs (Mistral 7B Instruct) and RAG capabilities, with dense vector semantic search and vector stores like Qdrant or Weaviate." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk167> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quantization methods such as INT8 will reduce energy consumption by approximately 80% compared to larger models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk168> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quarterly offline fine-tuning on anonymized data will comply with GDPR regulations while minimizing the need for real-time learning from user data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk169> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk170> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "CSR sustainability practices, through green hosting partners OVHcloud and Scaleway (100% renewable energy), digital sobriety measures (INT8/INT4 model quantisation reducing GPU energy by approximately 40%), auto-scaling, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy, will contribute to reducing the environmental footprint of the City of Belval systems. # 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk171> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Unaddressed Requirements Given the information provided, there is limited detail on the budgetary constraints and specific financial expectations beyond the global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk172> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Further clarification would be necessary to provide a detailed financial strategy and projected margin for the project. # 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk173> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Conclusion Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. specialized agents, offers a comprehensive solution that addresses the City of Belval requirements for an artificial intelligence assistance tool." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk174> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging Nexus Engineering S.r.l. expertise in technical architecture, security compliance, legal counsel, AI innovation, and CSR sustainability, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. are confident in delivering a high-quality solution that improves administrative service efficiency, respects regulatory requirements, and promotes sustainable development." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk175> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. look forward to the opportunity to discuss a comprehensive tender proposal for the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in the City of Belval in further detail and explore how Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can support the City of Belval digital transformation strategy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk19> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk2> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Context and objectives of the project In the framework of City of Belval digital transformation strategy, City of Belval wishes to improve the efficiency of City of Belval administrative services and the quality of service rendered to the users. the agents are today confronted with a growing complexity of the procedures, with a multiplicity of the sources of information (regulations, internal procedures, business systems) and with an increase of the volume of requests to process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk20> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sovereignty constraints the local authority grants a particular importance to the sovereignty of the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk21> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the hosting will have to be realized on an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, a particular attention will be brought to the dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers. 7." ;
